{#
  htpasswd users file for the Traefik dashboard (traefik.lehel.xyz).

  Mounted read-only into the traefik container and referenced by
  `basicAuth.usersFile` in traefik/dynamic.yaml (middleware `traefik-auth`).
  Because the file provider has watch: true, rotating the passphrase seed
  (plays/vars/.traefik_dashboard_password) and redeploying only changes this
  file — Traefik reloads its config and no container restart is needed.

  Rendered by roles/traefik_dashboard_auth (fact traefik_dashboard_auth_users).
  Format: exactly one `username:apr1-hash` line, nothing else — htpasswd
  parsers treat every non-empty line as an entry. No "$" escaping here: this
  file is mounted as-is and never goes through Docker Compose interpolation.
#}
